                    "Names relevant surgical specialties or procedures",
                    "States advantages and disadvantages",
                    "Identifies important complications and their prevention",
                    "Describes appropriate cleaning, inspection and sterilization",
                    "Distinguishes it from an osteotome and a Kerrison rongeur"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "group_id": "bone_rongeur_group_18",
              "group_title": "Final high-yield summary",
              "group_subtitle": null,
